{"seq":1,"slug":"pipeline","title":"Pipeline 流水线模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/patterns/pipeline","wordCount":556,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"pipeline-流水线模式\">Pipeline 流水线模式</h1><p>Pipeline 是 Go 并发模式中最基础也最优雅的拓扑——将数据处理拆分为多个串联阶段（stage），每个阶段由独立的 goroutine 驱动，阶段间通过 channel 连接。数据从源头流入第一个阶段，经逐级变换后从末端流出。这种结构天然具备背压（backpressure）机制：上游生产过快时会在 channel 上阻塞，自动降速。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Pipeline 的每个 stage 遵循统一签名：接收一个只读 channel 作为输入，返回一个只读 channel 作为输出。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    GEN[&quot;生成器 generate&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;chan int&quot;| SQ[&quot;平方 square&quot;]&#10;    SQ --&gt;|&quot;chan int&quot;| FLT[&quot;过滤 filter&quot;]&#10;    FLT --&gt;|&quot;chan int&quot;| SINK[&quot;消费者 sink&quot;]\">graph LR\n    GEN[\"生成器 generate\"] --&gt;|\"chan int\"| SQ[\"平方 square\"]\n    SQ --&gt;|\"chan int\"| FLT[\"过滤 filter\"]\n    FLT --&gt;|\"chan int\"| SINK[\"消费者 sink\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段类型</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>签名模板</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Source（源）</td>\n<td>产生数据流</td>\n<td><code>func gen(ctx, ...args) &lt;-chan T</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transform（变换）</td>\n<td>对每条数据做转换</td>\n<td><code>func transform(ctx, in &lt;-chan T) &lt;-chan U</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sink（汇）</td>\n<td>消费最终结果</td>\n<td><code>func sink(ctx, in &lt;-chan T)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"标准实现\">标准实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func generate(ctx context.Context, nums ...int) &lt;-chan int {&#10;    out := make(chan int)&#10;    go func() {&#10;        defer close(out)&#10;        for _, n := range nums {&#10;            select {&#10;            case out &lt;- n:&#10;            case &lt;-ctx.Done():&#10;                return&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }()&#10;    return out&#10;}&#10;&#10;func square(ctx context.Context, in &lt;-chan int) &lt;-chan int {&#10;    out := make(chan int)&#10;    go func() {&#10;        defer close(out)&#10;        for n := range in {&#10;            select {&#10;            case out &lt;- n * n:&#10;            case &lt;-ctx.Done():&#10;                return&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }()&#10;    return out&#10;}&#10;&#10;func filter(ctx context.Context, in &lt;-chan int, pred func(int) bool) &lt;-chan int {&#10;    out := make(chan int)&#10;    go func() {&#10;        defer close(out)&#10;        for n := range in {&#10;            if pred(n) {&#10;                select {&#10;                case out &lt;- n:&#10;                case &lt;-ctx.Done():&#10;                    return&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }()&#10;    return out&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ...int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-chan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shik